        - Important documents  \r                                                   
        - Hygiene kit  \r\n- Money  \r              - Flashlight  \r                             
        - Water bottle  \r                                                   - Clothes 
        \r\n- Towel  \r             - First aid kit  \r                                
        - Power bank  \r                                                   - Mobile
        phone  \r\nPicking up other items not listed will deduct your time.  \r\n"
